  "description": "Im Bong buys the famous classic at a used bookstore on the way home from work and reads it with anticipation. However, he discovers that the book he bought is a fake, and goes to sleep disappointed... But when he wakes up, he's the main character in the novel?!\n\nI was hoping for a romance with the beautiful Flower Fairy... What? The Flower Fairy is a man? \n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
